{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9175a1622f3b5a3b1cd5e84122f7fb066404328eda5a8c059333b7f72c0f2e5e", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nもしかして、俺に何か用事でしたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n你找我是不是有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "7110226349c433bdc0d79659769a842929edf8dc54478130d49db83ca0173205", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}さん！？　いつも\nナイスタイミングですね……まるで魔法みたい。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？总是来得正是时候呢……简直像魔法一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b9894114aa8f10819da0a8a9a613d83b1a3ebd78383ded7209e2e4f61d4aed65", "ja": "そうですか？　あ、魔法といえば、\nちょうど社長に呼ばれていて……。", "zh": "这样吗？啊，说到魔法，我正好被社长叫过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "d5f65e56f5e83062a8b4e0372455dcc993601cc479842a37a0d5bdf910e5bfda", "ja": "えっ！　社長さん、魔法使いなんですか！？\nどうりで……。", "zh": "诶！社长是魔法师吗！？\n难怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "af6b76fc11725a8e885bb76a8a3bd7c996e350611946d2baa88aa0b3d71bddd1", "ja": "いえ、そうではなく……以前、765プロ全員が\n出演した、魔法学園のドラマがありましたよね？", "zh": "不，不是那样的……以前，765事务所全员\n出演过一部魔法学院的电视剧，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "105572c9b0cd1b8aed5e738f958134c74c237e03fba1f1d90c28a20de35819c5", "ja": "今日、続編の打ち合わせがあって。\nこの後、事務所に行く予定なんです。", "zh": "今天要开续篇的讨论会。\n我打算之后去事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "3a105766340be3172fd5b04da1e639619540a39ed8425b1f1440cfa95191d1c0", "ja": "わぁ～！　とうとう動き出すんですね！？\nミリオンマグス学園の物語が……！", "zh": "哇～！终于要开始推进了吧！？\n《百万魔法学院》的故事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a1ae9dffc126f3fd9b844b750a927c8b97721f4d19d6ad0df7daf8bc84be41e7", "ja": "はい、今回も色々なアイディアを聞きました。\n楽しみですね！", "zh": "是的，这次也听到了各种各样的创意。\n真让人期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "4aae4ea0036c2857480c576db671838f626db27efa9e5c2cb7125789c95756a6", "ja": "どんなお話になるんでしょう？　ワクワクするな～。\n発表されたら、お姉ちゃんも喜ぶだろうな～。", "zh": "会变成什么样的故事呢？真让人期待呀～  \n等公布之后，姐姐一定也会很开心吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "a50c319eac5e5e5478613111e49746656f8bf71e92882b926639c671ec2533f7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、頑張ってください！\nその間、劇場の留守番はしっかりしておきますから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请加油！\n这段时间，剧场就交给我好好看着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "08534edc3a10350a2c18381a331dbd869911b200532bfc0b8baca7da16852854", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、行ってきます！", "zh": "谢谢。\n那么，我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "f79616fb085b9766129036125981bbdecdde2a630c7de4fd81eff733bc25ed26", "ja": "君！　待っていたよ。挨拶もそこそこで悪いが、\n早速、仕事の話をさせてもらっても構わないかね？", "zh": "你来了！我等你很久了。寒暄就先到此为止，\n我可以马上跟你谈谈工作上的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "778cd58dac23a6fd5c10be45f956176ae7e3629eaaa8f5a822c3aa81c1a42ef6", "ja": "もちろんです、社長！\n今日は魔法学園についての話でしたよね？", "zh": "当然可以，社长！\n今天是要谈魔法学院的事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "2ffb6e96323acaf7a9552dc4438eaae8afedc3234798f72deaadba7b2ed17568", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　今や人気タイトルだからね……。\nこちらも、気合いを入れて臨まなければ。", "zh": "就是这样！如今可是热门作品了……我们这边也必须打起精神来应对才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "71671d78e0c4c5fcf16356ba24fc98f5b2e695dcb47680232b04d42dd9914e98", "ja": "ミリオンマグス学園、映画も好評でしたけど。\nドラマ版からは、またファンが増えましたよね。", "zh": "《米利翁·马格斯学园》的电影也广受好评，不过……从电视剧版开始，粉丝又增加了不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "b58048fa7fe44747f3ba848bc35627d925b0565cdb9a2912e942fce22065eeec", "ja": "かくいう私も、続編をとっても楽しみにしてました♪\nあの後、どんなお話になるか気になっちゃって……。", "zh": "我也是，一直特别期待续篇♪  \n很想知道在那之后会展开怎样的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "cc40319e875b4fb7a24a87f7b8733df9d5bd9a92dc17f13dae5183724fb3026a", "ja": "うむ。子どもだましという言葉があるが、\nどんな大人だって、かつては子どもだったからね。", "zh": "嗯。虽说有哄小孩这种说法，\n但无论是怎样的大人，曾经也都是小孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "ed1aa1d9955c92237a466e680bfcde0458e65f2942220516170acae52c27370f", "ja": "子どもに響くものでなくては、大人にも響かない！\nこれは私のプロデュース論にも通じる話なんだが……。", "zh": "若是不能打动小孩子，那就无法打动大人！\n这其实也契合我的制作理念就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "513204f0804f31248483f8c4f60ffbf0487f43e0d68f18e0ec20be31efccaa55", "ja": "社長、社長！\n話が脇道にそれちゃってますよ！", "zh": "社长，社长！\n话题跑偏啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "33c78732057c7ac1badba2d7d48c1f1d1242821bb68c1fcd6eaa669a391bf5d9", "ja": "おっと、失礼。その話はまた次の機会にするとして……\nとにかく、魔法学園の続編制作が決定した！", "zh": "哎呀，失礼了。那件事就留到下次再说……\n总之，魔法学园续篇的制作已经确定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "0e78fca6ad4bde710e0deed9d9044dae2a1ad93165ac8a04a69dd055fa2b66ed", "ja": "いやはや、これは快挙だよ。\n本当におめでとう！", "zh": "哎呀呀，这可真是个壮举。\n真的太恭喜你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bdba0379f6df607264fcd12beea0cb38210d8a9a533d709852611e5e16ac646c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nアイドルのみんなの、頑張りのおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢您！\n多亏了偶像们的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "80c6043ead512cb3afa17b19f13d386e02fbe531f9a66bbc0daeaad8008aada9", "ja": "うむ！　今回も我が765プロのアイドル諸君が\n全員参加の、大がかりなドラマになるそうだ。", "zh": "嗯！　听说这次也是我们765事务所的偶像们\n全员参与的大型连续剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "89746aa31771a23d771ee8003c627bc355dacd78e689dab275ce166edf6a86f8", "ja": "52人の魅力的な魔法使いたち……その幻想的な\n物語を、再び君に託したい。お願いできるかね？", "zh": "52位极具魅力的魔法使们……这段奇幻的\n故事，我想再次托付给你。你能接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5873f390e13df3766e90a9873e79f8013b822d880f1c9b7ebfb2eb7348a0209e", "ja": "わかりました！　アイドルの頑張りを、\nひとりでも多くの人に届けたいと思います！", "zh": "明白了！我希望能将偶像们的努力，传达给尽可能多的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "81cb83c2299ae6e70bd8f514c3ec2e2e444b83e38c1341e6ebf2a6c2ed73ab01", "ja": "素敵なドラマになるよう、私も、精いっぱい\nお手伝いしちゃいますから。頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "为了让它成为一部精彩的电视剧，我也会竭尽全力帮忙的。请加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1028_se", "source_sha256": "a954734ecfe20d4fe4e853429c3aeea062cbe8437b0837f3daabe22c7168732c", "ja": "……バササササッ！", "zh": "……唰啦啦啦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "5b8f4f9e22ad97b66e61ee22cb10e28a732b057bc111a9dcd12825bd2099e6d0", "ja": "ハッ！　この羽音は……パブロ！\nグッジョブですね。その手紙を、こちらに……。", "zh": "哈！这个拍翅膀的声音是……帕布罗！\n干得好（Good job）。把那封信交给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "11005808949f0527b8af9d811a242cefcd9b9ca17ea39e223ce5ed387a015681", "ja": "む、むむ……むむむ……！", "zh": "唔、唔唔……唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1031_hato2", "source_sha256": "dfaec127c930800f81d6a6fd2540e966a97d9a4c48aaefbf293c115e9e0be269", "ja": "クルッポウ、クルッポウ！", "zh": "咕咕——，咕咕——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "f3dbc179bb79951786984e556f218428a0048534e875139b942d34d49a08de5b", "ja": "学園長……？　どうなさったんですか～？\n険しい表情をして……。", "zh": "学园长……？您怎么了吗～？\n表情这么严肃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "666e694ee7f2249fc1c874af287898a4601d6fe24b1de3e430017bc677f72e95", "ja": "トモカ……すこし、頼まれてくれますか？\n面倒なオーダーになりますが。", "zh": "朋花……能请你帮个忙吗？\n虽然会是一个麻烦的委托就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "12e1e0aa41c7d5f8ddb70ce4f27ff18727d3b5e57f0884bd6a092ccba106888c", "ja": "ええ、もちろん。私は学園長のパートナーですから。\nそれで、何をすれば良いんですか～？", "zh": "好的，当然可以。因为我是学园长的搭档嘛。\n那么，我该做些什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0355_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_intro_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "413f6b0a17b71e3f93c83e705eb7877c4803eec15e96ea8da22670db6432711a", "ja": "『塔』に行ってください。ただし、他の先生たちには\n気づかれないように……頼みましたよ。", "zh": "去一趟“塔”吧。但是，千万别被其他老师\n发觉了……就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
